{"status":"completed","summary":"Configured persistent rsyslog forwarding from node2 to node1. Inventory-tagged messages are stored in /var/log/inventory/node2.log. End-to-end flow and persistence were verified after sequential restarts of both nodes.","actions_performed":["Configured node1 to accept TCP syslog on port 514 only into an inventory-specific ruleset and file.","Permanently opened TCP/514 on node1 and verified the listener.","Configured node2 with an unlimited-retry, disk-assisted TCP forwarding queue for inventory-tagged messages.","Validated live message delivery before restarts.","Restarted node1 and node2 individually, proving changed boot identities and complete recovery.","Verified fresh inventory message delivery after each restart."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Centralized collector on node1","command_ids":["cmd-2b5bf8de50e44fcd","cmd-32919fa85f1742db"],"summary":"Collector configuration validates; rsyslog listens on TCP/514 and the firewall permits it persistently."},{"requirement":"Persistent forwarding from node2","command_ids":["cmd-e8011fd868ff4d12","cmd-45fd3293c3e44c1b"],"summary":"Node2 has valid, enabled rsyslog configuration using TCP, unlimited retries, and a persistent disk-assisted queue."},{"requirement":"Messages stored at /var/log/inventory/node2.log","command_ids":["cmd-f0e905226855443d","cmd-33ae361bd14c485c"],"summary":"The baseline inventory marker emitted on node2 appears in the required file on node1."},{"requirement":"Node1 restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-a09454d843994da4","cmd-3a343d4c792543ed","cmd-366b378067844dad","cmd-d2dc559d47fe4995","cmd-54ad6d85dc904ad4","cmd-dd8cc5b7ec874868"],"summary":"Boot ID changed from be303eb3-eeb6-4466-86f1-fd6406dd7dad to 8488d979-9215-4639-9a20-69409a731a29. The listener, firewall, existing data, and fresh post-restart delivery recovered."},{"requirement":"Node2 restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-45fd3293c3e44c1b","cmd-2f3b410cbedc48fa","cmd-018e0d2f17e941db","cmd-3c2f687f7ee74b70","cmd-b63cbdd06f914974"],"summary":"Boot ID changed from 96974ac3-f19e-45f7-9672-e880dd505cf8 to b4b3e683-4ff5-4019-863a-dc0dd969920f. Enabled rsyslog recovered, emitted a new inventory marker, and node1 persisted it successfully."}]}
